  <TM_AccelerateTimeHD.label>加速时空</TM_AccelerateTimeHD.label>
  <!--原中文: '迅速加速该生物的年龄。如果有任何其他影响转该生物的条件,也会改变他们的趋向。超过该生物寿命的生物经常受到与年龄有关的疾病或状况。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Rapidly ages a pawn. Any other conditions affecting the pawn will also accelerate their natural tendencies. Pawns aged beyond their typical lifespan are frequently beset by age related illnesses or conditions.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Rapidly ages a pawn. Any other conditions affecting the pawn will also accelerate their natural tendencies. Pawns aged beyond their typical lifespan are frequently beset by age related illnesses or conditions.-->
  <TM_AccelerateTimeHD.description>迅速加速该生物的年龄。如果有任何其他影响转该生物的条件,也会改变他们的趋向。超过该生物寿命的生物经常受到与年龄有关的疾病或状况。</TM_AccelerateTimeHD.description>
