  <TM_ReverseTimeBadHD.label>逆转未来</TM_ReverseTimeBadHD.label>
  <!--原中文: '迅速逆转该生物的年龄。如果有任何其他影响转该生物的条件,也会改变他们的趋向。如果该生物被逆转到条件发生前，那么条件将不再存在。如果该生物被逆转到出生前也将不复存在。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Rapidly reverses the age of a pawn. Any other conditions affecting the pawn will also reverse their natural tendencies. Conditions reversed beyond the point in time that they were acquired will cease to exist. Pawns reversed before the point int time that they were spawned will also cease to exist.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Rapidly reverses the age of a pawn. Any other conditions affecting the pawn will also reverse their natural tendencies. Conditions reversed beyond the point in time that they were acquired will cease to exist. Pawns reversed before the point int time that they were spawned will also cease to exist.-->
  <TM_ReverseTimeBadHD.description>迅速逆转该生物的年龄。如果有任何其他影响转该生物的条件,也会改变他们的趋向。如果该生物被逆转到条件发生前，那么条件将不再存在。如果该生物被逆转到出生前也将不复存在。</TM_ReverseTimeBadHD.description>
